.ruff_cache/

# PyPI configuration file
.pypirc

# Cursor
#  Cursor is an AI-powered code editor. `.cursorignore` specifies files/directories to
#  exclude from AI features like autocomplete and code analysis. Recommended for sensitive data
#  refer to https://docs.cursor.com/context/ignore-files
.cursorignore
.cursorindexingignore

# Claude Code
#  Local-only AI-assistant tooling config. Public developer documentation lives in
#  README.md and CONTRIBUTING.md; these files must remain strictly local and never
#  be tracked or shared in version control.
.claudeignore
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
#  Project-level MCP server config (developer tooling - personal token references
#  and local server paths vary per developer; not for public repo).
.mcp.json
#  Personal settings overrides - already covered by `.claude/` above; listed
#  explicitly so the intent survives any future narrowing of that rule.
.claude/settings.local.json
#  Cross-session agent state file (local-only working scaffold, like CLAUDE.md).
STATE.md
#  Internal strategic-planning and session-handoff documents - process artefacts
#  not intended for general users; results and decisions land in docs/ and commits.
docs/MASTER_STRATEGIC_PLAN.md
docs/STRATEGIC_PLAN_WEEK_5_6.md
docs/TOMORROW_STRATEGIC_PLAN.md
