# ─── Pattern-Based Protection (category-level, future-proof) ──────────────────
# The rules above name specific files reactively. These rules catch entire
# *categories* so future artifacts with different names are blocked automatically.

# Local development workspace - permanent safe harbor (belt-and-suspenders:
# _local/.gitignore also contains `*` so the directory can never leak even
# if this entry is accidentally removed)
_local/

